## Create Saving Jar

this file describes the Create saving jar feature.

1. "Add Caixinha"  should open a Modal
2. The modal should have a close button
3. The modal should have "Adicionar Caixinha" as Title
4. It should require Name, date and Goal(Value)
5. It should have a button with the title "Criar"
6. After user clicks, modal should close
7. User should view the toast with the succes/error message 
8. it should post to '/saving-jars'
9. it should send "name", "date" in the yyyy-mm-dd format, "goal"
10. after post success it should re-fetch the saving-jar